  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n    <img alt=\"Slice Icon\" title=\"Slice\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fc3a60516f4b9a25606c4bed70256fcda3018290.png\" width=\"512\">\n</p>\n\n<br>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/slice/versions?l=neoforge\"><img alt=\"neoforge\" src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy/supported/neoforge_vector.svg?raw=true\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/slice/versions?l=forge\"><img alt=\"forge\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/slice/versions?l=fabric\"><img alt=\"forge\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/slice/versions?l=quilt\"><img alt=\"forge\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\"></a>\n</p>\n\n## 功能特色\n- 靈活的版面控制，可調整半徑、物品大小與旋轉角度\n- 欄位、數字與圖示的顯示選項\n- 多種互動模式（切換選單或點擊選擇物品）\n- 可配置的內外側死區\n- 快捷欄滾動開關\n- 支援自訂材質包\n\n## 遊戲截圖\n\n![alt text](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ansi-sudo/Slice/HEAD/.github/InGame1.png)\n[點擊觀看宣傳片/示範影片](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kq3pwFCv4ZM)\n\n## 支援版本\n> ✅ - 已支援，❌ - 未支援，🔍 - 計畫中 / 開發中\n\n<table>\n    <th>版本</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>載入器</th>\n    <th>最低所需版本</th>\n    <th>最新 Slice 版本</th>\n    <tr><td>26.1.2</td>  <td>✅</td>\n        <td>\n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy-minimal/supported/neoforge_vector.svg?raw=true\"> \n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/forge/cozy-minimal.svg\"> \n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/fabric/cozy-minimal.svg\">\n        </td>\n        <td><code>26.1.2.0-beta</code>, <code>64.0.0</code>, <code>0.18.4</code></td>\n        <td><code>1.0.2</code></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr><td>26.1.1</td>  <td>✅</td>\n        <td>\n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy-minimal/supported/neoforge_vector.svg?raw=true\"> \n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/forge/cozy-minimal.svg\"> \n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/fabric/cozy-minimal.svg\">\n        </td>\n        <td><code>26.1.1.0-beta</code>, <code>63.0.1</code>, <code>0.18.4</code></td>\n        <td><code>1.0.2</code></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr><td>26.1</td> <td>✅</td>\n        <td>\n            <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy-minimal/supported/neoforge_vector.svg?raw=true\"> \n            <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/fabric/cozy-minimal.svg\">\n        </td>\n        <td><code>26.1.0.1-beta</code>, <code>0.18.4</code></td>\n        <td><code>1.0.1</code></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr><td>1.21.11</td>  <td>✅</td>\n        <td>\n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/8494ec1ac495cfb481dc7e458356325510933eb0/assets/cozy-minimal/supported/neoforge_vector.svg?raw=true\"> \n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/forge/cozy-minimal.svg\"> \n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/fabric/cozy-minimal.svg\">\n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://badges.penpow.dev/badges/supported/quilt/cozy-minimal.svg\">\n        </td>\n        <td><code>21.11.0</code>, <code>61.0.0</code>, <code>0.18.0</code>, <code>0.30.0-beta</code></td>\n        <td><code>1.0.0</code></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr><td>1.21.10</td>  <td>✅</td>\n        <td>\n          <img width=\"35\" src=\"https://gith